    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu2sQJs0l7dEYabpiVTzWFBOtRG3.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期「aLog」包含时间跨度 123 天的 12 条片段，取自小翔和三位朋友的生活。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:00:05</a>电梯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:00:53</a>每个八度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">00:07:23</a>对方网络不佳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">00:08:52</a>风筝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">00:10:16</a>书签的背面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">00:11:30</a>抽湿机和背着花的陌生男生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">00:14:06</a>菜市场的小猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">00:15:37</a>冰箱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">00:16:54</a>一块很小的屏幕里播着再见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">00:20:17</a>下午茶吃法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">00:22:04</a>不加糖的阿华田</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">00:23:09</a>Snap-on</span></p><span></span><p><span>「aLog」取材于小翔和朋友们的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一种以音频形式记录生活片段的东西，audio+blog，就像把生活切成薄片，再随机抽出来几张看看。我对其中的一些记忆犹新，对另外一些感到陌生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📧欢迎大家也拿起手机一起来aLog并将你喜欢的片段发送 </span><strong><span>shouyanxietiaopodcast@gmail.com</span></strong><span> 希望在未来的aLog音频里我们的声音可以穿插进行。</span></p>]]></description>
