    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhN1z34C7xDApkVKKDbFzU8wBuPA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期「aLog」包含时间跨度 30 天的 18 条片段。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:00:06</a>小宝影院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">00:01:28</a>直到打开电脑前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">00:05:47</a>最近的路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">00:07:01</a>鱼香肉丝盒饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">00:07:37</a>Google map 五百次浏览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">00:09:12</a>脱掉外套</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">00:10:03</a>Prince St</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">00:10:25</a>一股蒜味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">00:11:09</a>修浴缸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">00:12:45</a>丢袜子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">00:13:55</a>所有人都给我发微信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">00:14:27</a>窗外在放烟花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">00:14:52</a>拧紧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">00:15:32</a>橘子汁不好喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">00:16:42</a>美术馆周四夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">00:17:17</a>我忘了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">00:18:16</a>雨里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">00:19:33</a>假梦迟到</span></p><span></span><p><span>「aLog」取材于小翔的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一种以音频形式记录生活片段的东西，audio+blog，就像把生活切成薄片，再随机抽出来几张看看。我对其中的一些记忆犹新，对另外一些感到陌生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📧欢迎大家也拿起手机一起来aLog并将你喜欢的片段发送至</span><strong><span>shouyanxietiaopodcast@gmail.com</span></strong><span> 希望在未来的aLog音频里我们的声音可以穿插进行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里是连接发生的地方。</span></p>]]></description>
