  <item>
    <title>离别｜aLog</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645f3e067d934b850562b238</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645f3e067d934b850562b238</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 May 2023 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhN1z34C7xDApkVKKDbFzU8wBuPA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期「aLog」包含时间跨度 28 天的 19 条片段。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:00:04</a>全身粉色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:00:53</a>叫我去搂席</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">00:01:59</a>很像初中同学的微博账号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">00:03:33</a>狗挠头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">00:05:00</a>太阳雨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">00:06:14</a>花园樱桃被鸟吃掉了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">00:09:35</a>好结实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">00:10:13</a>忘买冷萃液</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">00:11:54</a>下雨天翻衣服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">00:13:26</a>CRAFT堵人失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">00:16:45</a>音响声音会不会大一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">00:17:06</a>旧沙发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">00:19:05</a>约了四五次终于约上了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">00:20:37</a>显示器搬走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">00:22:55</a>本科毕业典礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">00:23:08</a>毕业典礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">00:24:15</a>风吹动叶片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">00:24:53</a>最好给我来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">00:25:10</a>离别</span></p><span></span><p><span>「aLog」取材于小翔的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一种以音频形式记录生活片段的东西，audio+blog，就像把生活切成薄片，再随机抽出来几张看看。我对其中的一些记忆犹新，对另外一些感到陌生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📧欢迎大家也拿起手机一起来aLog并将你喜欢的片段发送至</span><strong><span>shouyanxietiaopodcast@gmail.com</span></strong><span> 希望在未来的aLog音频里我们的声音可以穿插进行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里是连接发生的地方。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljZAuN0_B2XNzv1nDHZXI5Yb-gQv.m4a" length="52047991" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqN0EzY0J2NV9vMkM4UG9fWW84b3R2STE5eW4ucG5n.png"/>
