    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhN1z34C7xDApkVKKDbFzU8wBuPA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期「aLog」包含时间跨度 16 天的 18 条片段。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:00:05</a>睡过了压纹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:00:47</a>咖啡店大提琴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">00:01:09</a>延误三小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">00:04:26</a>延误的道理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">00:04:51</a>腊肠尿尿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">00:06:14</a>被榨干了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">00:07:14</a>裤子掉了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">00:08:25</a>奥斯汀伯格斯特龙国际机场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">00:10:19</a>咖啡烫口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">00:11:08</a>床上充电器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">00:12:08</a>草莓 cream cheese</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">00:12:56</a>健身完吃 pho</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">00:16:50</a>不健身了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">00:18:26</a>沙滩排球女孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">00:21:23</a>银行业务员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">00:22:52</a>爸爸妈妈的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">00:24:26</a>握住纸杯子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">00:26:27</a>飞起来的湖泊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">00:28:22</a>一起来aLog</span></p><span></span><p><span>「aLog」取材于小翔的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一种以音频形式记录生活片段的东西，audio+blog，就像把生活切成薄片，再随机抽出来几张看看。我对其中的一些记忆犹新，对另外一些感到陌生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📧欢迎大家也拿起手机一起来aLog并将你喜欢的片段发送至</span><strong><span>shouyanxietiaopodcast@gmail.com</span></strong><span> 希望在未来的aLog音频里我们的声音可以穿插进行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这里是连接发生的地方。</span></p>]]></description>
